{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-1afa4f10", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the region VBF signal region (VBF-SR)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the region VBF signal region (VBF-SR):\n\n- **2007.02873**: \"Measurements of \\( WH \\) and \\( ZH \\) production in the \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decay channel in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( 13\\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2009.04363**: \"Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\"\n- **2009.14537**: \"Observation and measurement of forward proton scattering in association with lepton pairs produced via the photon fusion mechanism at ATLAS\"\n- **2011.07812**: \"Search for displaced leptons in \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV \\( pp \\) collisions with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2205.05120**: \"Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\"\n- **2206.09466**: \"Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the \\( \\mathup{{{W}}} \\) boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\"\n- **2404.06204**: \"Precise measurements of \\( W \\) - and \\( Z \\) -boson transverse momentum spectra with the ATLAS detector using \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=5.02 \\) TeV and \\( 13 \\) TeV\"\n- **2407.10549**: \"Search for dark matter produced in association with a dark Higgs boson in the \\( b\\bar{b} \\) final state using \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2510.07527**: \"Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\"\n- **2605.14245**: \"Constraints on anomalous Higgs 