{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-1f46d883", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the region MB/BDT-CRW (W+jets control region)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the region MB/BDT-CRW (W+jets control region):\n\n1. **Search for squarks and gluinos in final states with jets and missing transverse momentum using 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of \\(\\sqrt{s} = 13\\) TeV \\(pp\\) collision data with the ATLAS detector** (arXiv: 2010.14293)\n2. **Search for chargino-neutralino production in events with Higgs and \\(W\\) bosons using 137 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s} = 13\\) TeV** (arXiv: 2107.12553)\n3. **Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state** (arXiv: 2205.05120)\n4. **Search for pair production of vector-like quarks in leptonic final states in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s} = 13\\) TeV** (arXiv: 2209.07327)\n\nThese papers are the ones that specifically define the region MB/BDT-CRW (W+jets control region).", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2008.05928", "2010.14293", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2209.07327", "2302.05225", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2510.07527", "2511.11853"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "MB/BDT-CRW (W+jets control region)", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 36.702}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1_kept"}, "rows": 4, "error": null, "seconds": 0.028}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids"