{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-29cdf3cb", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses report the systematic uncertainty Background normalisation uncertainties (combined inclusive fit)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses report the systematic uncertainty \"Background normalisation uncertainties (combined inclusive fit)\":\n\n- **2001.06899**: Measurement of the associated production of a Z boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV.\n- **2009.14537**: Observation and measurement of forward proton scattering in association with lepton pairs produced via the photon fusion mechanism at ATLAS.\n- **2103.04956**: Measurements of production cross sections of the Higgs boson in the four-lepton final state in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$.\n- **2112.00895**: Measurements of the associated production of a W boson and a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=8\\, \\text{TeV}$.\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$.\n- **2206.09466**: Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the W boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$.\n- **2207.12246**: Measurement of the total cross section and $\\rho$-parameter from elastic scattering in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2303.15340**: Inclusive and differential cross-sections for dilepton $t\\bar{t}$ production measured in $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$ $pp$ collisions with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2308.02285**: Measurement of the production cross section for a W boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$.\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations.\n- **2401.05299**: Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of $t\\bar{t}W$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2402.08486**: Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$.\n- **2504.13081**: Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$.\n- **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$.\n- **2604.27044**: Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 $b$ final state.\n- **2605.14245**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$.\n\nThese are the distinct papers that report", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Background normalisation uncertainties (combined inclusive fit)", "kind": "systematic_uncertainty"}, "rows": 104, "error": null, "seconds": 83.859}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_has_systematic", "object_set": "set_1_kept"}, "rows": 49, "error": null, "seconds": 0.042}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:c77dc93c4243dc6282c1e450", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:d4ebc4413bef90f04142edbe", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:672f1e37310a4b762adc7a8c", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:1724c3004deb2fe7c06e27d8", "hepkg:result:c223e8afe1e53690005d65ee", "hepkg:result:8e885d9541438f775548eee6", "hepkg:result:de78c3f754afbc4965051e45", "hepkg:result:f5b1d9536f2db25c7969a697", "hepkg:result:6b87d4fa6369adc316efb3b5", "hepkg:result:98870936d56c0284b1c0a718", "hepkg:result:9d25af0f1177d39097fa3f12"]}, "rows": 16, "error": null, "seconds": 0.01}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:syst:background_fit", "hepkg:syst:integrated_luminosity", "hepkg:syst:other_systematic_group", "hepkg:systematic:alignment", "hepkg:systematic:background-estimation-uncertainty", "hepkg:systematic:background-extrapolation-bias", "hepkg:systematic:background-function-choice-bias", "hepkg:systematic:background-normalisations", "hepkg:systematic:background-normalization", "hepkg:systematic:background-shape-fourier", "hepkg:systematic:background-stat-ratio", "hepkg:systematic:background-total-uncertainty", "hepkg:systematic:background-variance-kfold", "hepkg:systematic:background_normalization_minor", "hepkg:systematic:background_parametrization_choice_uncertainty", "hepkg:systematic:background_rate_normalization", "hepkg:systematic:background_sample_size", "hepkg:systematic:background_subtraction", "hepkg:systematic:btag-calibration