{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-3f577d3e", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the object Particle-flow (PF) candidate?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the object \"Particle-flow (PF) candidate\":\n\n1. **2004.04545**: *\"$CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the $t\\bar{t}H$ and $tH$ Processes Using $H\\rightarrow\\gamma\\gamma$ with the ATLAS Detector\"*\n2. **2109.13808**: *\"Constraints on Higgs boson properties using $WW^{*}(\\rightarrow e\\nu\\mu\\nu)jj$ production in $36.1\\text{\\,}{\\mathrm{fb}}^{-1}$ of $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV $pp$ collisions with the ATLAS detector\"*\n3. **2111.08340**: *\"Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector\"*\n4. **2202.08676**: *\"Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"*\n5. **2205.05120**: *\"Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\"*\n6. **2401.05299**: *\"Three leptons ($3\\ell$)\"*\n7. **2503.19420**: *\"3-lepton final state (WH, all bosons leptonic)\"*\n8. **2503.19420**: *\"4-lepton final state (ZH, all bosons leptonic)\"*\n9. **2504.13081**: *\"Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"*\n10. **2510.07527**: *\"Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"*\n11. **2604.21670**: *\"Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the 