{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-58a2291e", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses measured Total Higgs boson production cross section (sigma_tot)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses measured the Total Higgs boson production cross section (sigma_tot):\n\n1. **2001.06899**: Measurement of the associated production of a \\( \\mathup{{{Z}}} \\) boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n2. **2004.04545**: \\( CP \\) Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the \\( t\\bar{t}H \\) and \\( tH \\) Processes Using \\( H\\rightarrow\\gamma\\gamma \\) with the ATLAS Detector.\n3. **2008.05928**: Search for Heavy Resonances Decaying into a Photon and a Hadronically Decaying Higgs Boson in \\( pp \\) Collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{Te\\kern-1.00006ptV} \\) with the ATLAS Detector.\n4. **2103.04956**: Measurements of production cross sections of the Higgs boson in the four-lepton final state in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\).\n5. **2103.06956**: Measurements of Higgs boson production cross sections and couplings in the diphoton decay channel at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\).\n6. **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector.\n7. **2206.09466**: Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the \\( \\mathup{{{W}}} \\) boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\).\n8. **2207.12246**: Measurement of the total cross section and \\( \\rho \\)-parameter from elastic scattering in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n9. **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations.\n10. **2408.03744**: Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for \\( \\mathup{{{W}}} \\) and \\( \\mathup{{{Z}}} \\) boson production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=5.02 \\) and 13  TeV.\n11. **2504.13081**: Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\).\n12. **2602.18611**: Inclusive Higgs boson signal strength measurement.\n13. **2602.18611**: Per-production-and-decay-channel Higgs boson signal strength measurement (31 POIs).\n14. **2602.18611", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2201.11585", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2209.07327", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2510.07527", "2602.18611"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Total Higgs boson production cross section (sigma_tot)", "kind": "observable"}, "rows": 78, "error": null, "seconds": 78.382}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_measures_observable", "object_set": "set_1_kept"}, "rows": 30, "error": null, "seconds": 0.041}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:109c1212671935ca00101cdf", "hepkg:result:c77dc93c4243dc6282c1e450", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:coupling_effective_offshell", "hepkg:result:incl_signal_strength", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:172