{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-700995b9", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses used the sample ZZ diboson production MC sample?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses used the ZZ diboson production MC sample:\n\n- **2004.01678**: \"Search for Higgs Boson Decays into a $Z$ Boson and a Light Hadronically Decaying Resonance Using 13 TeV $pp$ Collision Data from the ATLAS Detector\"\n- **2007.02873**: \"Measurements of $WH$ and $ZH$ production in the $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decay channel in $pp$ collisions at $13\\, \\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2009.04363**: \"Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\"\n- **2103.04956**: \"Measurements of production cross sections of the Higgs boson in the four-lepton final state in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2106.14246**: \"Search for electroweak production of charginos and neutralinos in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2107.12553**: \"Search for chargino-neutralino production in events with Higgs and $\\mathup{W}$ bosons using 137 $\\, \\text{fb}^{-1}$ of proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2110.11231**: \"Measurement of the inclusive and differential ${\\mathup{W}}{\\mathup{Z}}$ production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in ${\\mathup{p}}{\\mathup{p}}$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2112.00895**: \"Measurements of the associated production of a W boson and a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=8\\, \\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2112.03161**: \"Search for heavy resonances decaying to a pair of Lorentz-boosted Higgs bosons in final states with leptons and a bottom quark pair at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2201.11585**: \"Search for invisible decays of th