{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-8ca062ac", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses measured f_Lambda1^Zgamma (HVV effective fractional cross section)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses measured observables related to \\( f_{\\Lambda1}^{Z\\gamma} \\) (HVV effective fractional cross section):\n\n- **2004.01678**: \"Search for Higgs Boson Decays into a \\( Z \\) Boson and a Light Hadronically Decaying Resonance Using 13 TeV \\( pp \\) Collision Data from the ATLAS Detector\"\n- **2004.04545**: \"\\$CP\\$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the \\( t\\bar{t}H \\) and \\( tH \\) Processes Using \\( H\\rightarrow\\gamma\\gamma \\) with the ATLAS Detector\"\n- **2007.02873**: \"Measurements of \\( WH \\) and \\( ZH \\) production in the \\( H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decay channel in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( 13\\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2008.05928**: \"Search for Heavy Resonances Decaying into a Photon and a Hadronically Decaying Higgs Boson in \\( pp \\) Collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS Detector\"\n- **2103.04956**: \"Measurements of production cross sections of the Higgs boson in the four-lepton final state in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\"\n- **2110.11231**: \"W boson polarization fraction measurement in WZ production\"\n- **2312.04450**: \"Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\"\n- **2401.05299**: \"Fiducial \\( t\\bar{t}W \\) cross-section measurement result\"\n- **2602.18611**: \"Per-decay-channel Higgs boson signal strength measurement\"\n- **2602.18611**: \"Resolved Higgs boson coupling modifier fit\"\n- **2602.18611**: \"Effective coupling modifier fit assuming no additional BSM decays\"\n- **2602.18611**: \"Coupling modifier ratio fit\"\n- **2604.27044**: \"Resolved Run 3 analysis, first approach (transformer-based) HH results\"\n- **2604.27044**: \"Resolved Run 3 analysis, second approach (FeynNet GNN) HH results\"\n- **2604.27044**: \"Updated resolved analysis with Run 2 data (ggHH) results\"\n- **2604.27044**: \"Merged Run 3 analysis, first approach, mass-fit method results\"\n- **2604.27044**: \"Merged Run 3 analysis, first approach, DNN-fit method results\"\n- **2604.27044**: \"Merged Run 3 analysis, second approach (parametric alphabet) results\"\n- **2604.27044**: \"Combined Run 3 resolved+merged HH->4b result\"\n- **2604.27044**: \"Combined Run 2 + Run 3 HH->4b result\"", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.14537", "2103.04956", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2207.12246", "2302.05225", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2404.06204", "2408.03744", "2504.13081", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "f_Lambda1^Zgamma", "kind": "observable"}, "rows": 35, "error": null, "seconds": 19.166}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_measures_observable", "object_set": "set_1_kept"}, "rows": 28, "error": null, "seconds": 0.041}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:109c1212671935ca00101cdf", "hepkg:result:combined-run2-run3", "hepkg:result:combined-run3", "hepkg:result:coupling_modifier_ratios", "hepkg:result:coupling_effective_bsm0", "hepkg:result:ttw-fiducial-xsec", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:3c55ab19d48206f55f056f4a", "hepkg:result:f5b1d9536f2db25c7969a697", "hepkg:result:merged-run3-approach1-dnnfit", "hepkg:result:merged-run3-approach1-massfit", "hepkg:result:merged-run3-approach2", "hep