{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-97ed8950", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background Other Higgs background (VH production and H->tautau decays)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate the background \"Other Higgs background (VH production and H->tautau decays)\":\n\n- **2008.05928**: \"Search for Heavy Resonances Decaying into a Photon and a Hadronically Decaying Higgs Boson in \\( pp \\) Collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS Detector\"\n- **2103.06956**: \"Measurements of Higgs boson production cross sections and couplings in the diphoton decay channel at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\"\n- **2107.12553**: \"Search for chargino-neutralino production in events with Higgs and \\( W \\) bosons using 137 \\( \\, \\text{fb}^{-1} \\) of proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\"\n- **2109.13808**: \"ggF + 2 jets CP-sensitive analysis of the effective Higgs-gluon coupling\"\n- **2109.13808**: \"VBF HVV polarisation-coupling analysis (a_L, a_T / kappa_VV, epsilon_VV)\"\n- **2110.11231**: \"Measurement of the inclusive and differential \\( WZ \\) production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\"\n- **2202.08676**: \"Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\"\n- **2207.00348**: \"Measurement of the properties of Higgs boson production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV in the \\( H \\to \\gamma\\gamma \\) channel using 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of \\( pp \\) collision data with the ATLAS experiment\"\n- **2208.12095**: \"Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\to t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2312.04450**: \"Inclus