{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-b9727ddc", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses report the systematic uncertainty ECAL upstream material modeling uncertainty?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses report the systematic uncertainty \"ECAL upstream material modeling uncertainty\":\n\n- **2007.02873**: Measurements of \\( WH \\) and \\( ZH \\) production in the \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decay channel in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( 13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector\n- **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2207.00348**: Measurement of the properties of Higgs boson production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV in the \\( H \\to \\gamma\\gamma \\) channel using \\( 139 \\) fb\\(^{-1}\\) of \\( pp \\) collision data with the ATLAS experiment\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2308.02285**: Measurement of the production cross section for a \\( W \\) boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2309.14442**: Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}b\\bar{b} \\) production in the lepton+jets channel at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\n- **2401.05299**: Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of \\( t\\bar{t}W \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2402.08486**: Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2408.03744**: Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for \\( W \\) and \\( Z \\) boson production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=5.02 \\) and 13 TeV\n- **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2510.07527**: Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2602.18611**: Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2604.21670**: Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "ECAL upstream material modeling uncertainty", "kind": "systematic_uncertainty"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 30.337}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "arg