{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-cb658f9d", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background Diboson ($WW$, $WZ$, $ZZ$) background?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate the Diboson ($WW$, $WZ$, $ZZ$) background:\n\n1. **2004.14060**: \"Search for a scalar partner of the top quark in the all-hadronic $t\\bar{t}$ plus missing transverse momentum final state at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\"\n2. **2007.02873**: \"Measurements of $WH$ and $ZH$ production in the $H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decay channel in $pp$ collisions at $13\\,\\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector\"\n3. **2106.01676**: \"Search for chargino–neutralino pair production in final states with three leptons and missing transverse momentum in $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV $pp$ collisions with the ATLAS detector\"\n4. **2106.14246**: \"Search for electroweak production of charginos and neutralinos in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n5. **2202.08676**: \"Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n6. **2205.05120**: \"Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\"\n7. **2206.09466**: \"Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the $W$ boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n8. **2208.12095**: \"Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\"\n9. **2304.08962**: \"Observation of an excess of di-charmonium events in the four-muon final state with the ATLAS detector\"\n10. **2308.02285**: \"Measurement of the production cross section for a $W$ boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n11. **2312.04450**: \"Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\"\n12. **2401.05299**: \"Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of $t\\bar{t}W$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\"\n13. **2404.06204**: \"Precise measurements of $W$ - and $Z$ -boson transverse momentum spectra with the ATLAS detector using $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=5.02$ TeV and $13$ TeV\"\n14. **2405.18661**: \"CMS ttbar+W (ttW) associated production cross section measurement\"\n15. **2408.03744**: \"Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for $W$ and $Z$ boson production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=5.0", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2109.13808", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Diboson", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 21, "error": null, "seconds": 13.164}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 38, "error": null, "seconds": 0.036}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:ttw_measurement", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:multilepton", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:dbe00b660bc7b95a46e94404", "hep