{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-cd1c2f68", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses used the sample Single top tW sample (powheg v2)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses used the sample \"Single top tW sample (powheg v2)\":\n\n- **2001.06899**: Measurement of the associated production of a \\( Z \\) boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n- **2006.05880**: Search for top squarks in events with a Higgs or \\( Z \\) boson using 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of \\( pp \\) collision data at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2007.02873**: Measurements of \\( WH \\) and \\( ZH \\) production in the \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decay channel in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( 13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2010.14293**: Search for squarks and gluinos in final states with jets and missing transverse momentum using 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of \\( \\sqrt{s} = 13 \\) TeV \\( pp \\) collision data with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2106.01676**: Search for chargino–neutralino pair production in final states with three leptons and missing transverse momentum in \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV \\( pp \\) collisions with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state.\n- **2206.09466**: Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the \\( W \\) boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2209.07327**: Search for pair production of vector-like quarks in leptonic final states in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2211.08028**: Search for supersymmetry in final states with missing transverse momentum and three or more \\( b \\)-jets in 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of proton–proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2309.14442**: Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}b\\bar{b} \\) production in the lepton+jets channel at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2509.22535**: Simultaneous probe of the charm and bottom quark Yukawa couplings using \\( t\\bar{t}H \\) events.\n- **2604.27044**: Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 \\( b \\) final state.\n\nThese are the distinct papers that used the specified sample.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2407.10549", "2503.19420", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Single top tW sample (powheg v2)", "kind": "sample"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 32.001}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_uses_sample", "object_set": "set_1_kept"}, "rows": 13, "error": null, "seconds": 0.035}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:a6cd17820e382d3557564ac2", "hepkg:result:1724c3004deb2fe7c06e27d8", "hepkg:result:3c55ab19d48206f55f056f4a", 