{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-e659786a", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background Nonprompt lepton (reducible) background from Z+jets and ttbar?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The graph does not record any analyses that explicitly estimate the background \"Nonprompt lepton (reducible) background\" from Z+jets and ttbar. However, there are several analyses that use Z+jets and ttbar samples:\n\n1. **Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into \\(WW^*\\) with the ATLAS detector at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:ca408cb17d5fce2b056fcc4e`)\n2. **Search for chargino–neutralino pair production in final states with three leptons and missing transverse momentum in \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV \\(pp\\) collisions with the ATLAS detector** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:145b646dbebeacbefd96614b`)\n3. **Search for heavy resonances decaying to a pair of Lorentz-boosted Higgs bosons in final states with leptons and a bottom quark pair at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\)** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:faf187c3052688d9764c6e95`)\n4. **Search for pair production of vector-like quarks in leptonic final states in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\)** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:65e536ea4e5f3196d16e8bfc`)\n5. **Search for supersymmetry in final states with missing transverse momentum and three or more \\(b\\)-jets in 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of proton–proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:d0ff6542be328ba2a125a5cb`)\n6. **VBF HVV polarisation-coupling analysis (a_L, a_T / kappa_VV, epsilon_VV)** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:vbf_hvv_polarization_analysis`)\n7. **ggF + 2 jets CP-sensitive analysis of the effective Higgs-gluon coupling** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:ggf2jets_cp_analysis`)\n\nThese analyses use Z+jets and ttbar samples, but the specific estimation of the \"Nonprompt lepton (reducible) background\" from these samples is not recorded in the graph.\n\nTo provide a complete answer, we would need to check the detailed methods used in these analyses to see if they include the estimation of the nonprompt lepton background from Z+jets and ttbar. However, based on the current information in the graph, no such specific estimation is recorded.\n\nAnswer: The graph does not record any analyses that explicitly estimate the background \"Nonprompt lepton (reducible) background\" from Z+jets and ttbar. However, several analyses use Z+jets and ttbar samples, and further details on their methods would be needed to determine if they include the estimation of the nonprompt lepton background from these samples.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"text\": \"The graph does not record any analyses that explicitly estimate the background 'Nonprompt lepton (reducible) background' from Z+jets and ttbar. However, several analyses use Z+jets and ttbar samples, and further details on their methods would be needed to determine if they include the estimation of the nonprompt lepton background from these samples.\",\n  \"answerable\": false,\n  \"reason\": \"not_in_graph\"\n}\n```", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "