{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-1e891a79", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background $W{+}\\text{jets}$ background?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The following analyses estimate the $W{+}\\\\text{jets}$ background:\\n\\n- **2004.14060**: *Search for a scalar partner of the top quark in the all-hadronic $t\\\\bar{t}$ plus missing transverse momentum final state at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector*\\n- **2007.02873**: *Measurements of $WH$ and $ZH$ production in the $H\\\\rightarrow b\\\\bar{b}$ decay channel in $pp$ collisions at $13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\kern-1.00006ptV}$ with the ATLAS detector*\\n- **2107.12553**: *Search for chargino-neutralino production in events with Higgs and $\\\\mathup{{{W}}}$ bosons using 137 $\\\\,\\\\text{fb}^{-1}$ of proton-proton collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$*\\n- **2111.08340**: *Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H\\\\rightarrow b\\\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector*\\n- **2202.08676**: *Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$*\\n- **2205.05120**: *Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state*\\n- **2208.12095**: *Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp\\\\rightarrow t\\\\bar{t}$ production at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector*\\n- **2308.02285**: *Measurement of the production cross section for a $\\\\mathup{{{W}}}$ boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$*\\n- **2312.04450**: *Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations*\\n- **2503.19420**: *Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into $WW^{\\\\ast}$ with the ATLAS detector at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV*\\n- **2511.11853**: *Search for a new neutral gauge boson produced in association with one or two b jets and decaying into a pair of muons in proton-proton collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$*\\n- **2602.18611**: *Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$*\\n- **2604", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2007.02873", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2111.08340", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "W+jets", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 12, "error": null, "seconds": 5.592}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 43, "error": null, "seconds": 0.035}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:c223e8afe1e53690005d65ee", "hepkg:result:3c55ab19d48206f55f056f4a", "hepkg:result:ca408cb17d5fce2b056fcc4e", "hepkg:result:a1be093dbc0132aef0ad80b2", "hepkg:result:260119c5314b01ee54efcb2b", "hepk