{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-355bd42b", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses measured Global Higgs boson signal strength modifier μ = σB(H→WW)/σB(H→WW)_SM?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses measured the Global Higgs boson signal strength modifier \\( \\mu = \\sigma B(H \\to WW) / \\sigma B(H \\to WW)_{\\text{SM}} \\):\n\n1. **2004.04545**: \"$CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the $t\\bar{t}H$ and $tH$ Processes Using $H \\to \\gamma\\gamma$ with the ATLAS Detector\"\n2. **2111.08340**: \"Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H \\to b\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector\"\n3. **2504.13081**: \"Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n4. **2510.07527**: \"Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n5. **2602.18611**: \"Effective coupling modifier fit assuming no additional BSM decays\"\n6. **2602.18611**: \"Effective coupling modifier fit with $B_{\\text{inv}}$, $B_{\\text{undet}}$ floating and $|\\kappa_V| \\leq 1$ constraint\"\n7. **2602.18611**: \"Coupling modifier ratio fit\"\n8. **2604.21670**: \"Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons and the top quark\"\n9. **2604.27044**: \"Combined Run 3 resolved+merged HH->4b result\"\n10. **2604.27044**: \"Combined Run 2 + Run 3 HH->4b result\"\n\nThese papers cover various aspects of Higgs boson signal strength measurements, including differential cross sections, effective coupling modifiers, and combined results from multiple datasets.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.04545", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2109.13808", "2111.08340", "2201.11585", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2307.01094", "2312.04450", "2407.10549", "2504.13081", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Global Higgs boson signal strength modifier μ = σB(H→WW)/σB(H→WW)_SM", "kind": "observable"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 35.479}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_measures_observable", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 110, "error": null, "seconds": 0.044}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:109c1212671935ca00101cdf", "hepkg:result:c77dc93c4243dc6282c1e450", "hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437", "hepkg:result:combined-run2-run3", "hepkg:result:combined-run3", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:coupling_modifier_ratios", "hepkg:result:coupling_effective_bsm0", "hepkg:result:coupling_effective_binv_kv1", "hepkg:result:4a162a98ce57274854442b0f"]}, "rows": 10, "error": null, "seconds": 0.009}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:observable:abs_y_h", "hepkg:observable:acceptance_efficiency", "hepkg:observable:br_h_to_inv", "hepkg:observable:bsm_branching_fraction_invisible", "hepkg:observable:coupling_modifier_effective", "hepkg:observable:coupling_modifier_ratio", "hepkg:observable:coupling_modifier_resolved", "hepkg:observable:eft_coefficient_constraints", "hepkg:observable:fit_basis_linear_no_dihiggs", "hepkg:observable:fit_basis_linear_quadratic", "hepkg:observable:fit_basis_linear_with_dihiggs", "hepkg:observable:hh_incl_signal_strength", "hepkg:observable:hh_vbf_signal_strength", "hepkg:observable:higgs_br_ul", "hepkg:observable:higgs_branching_fraction_ratio", "hepkg:observable:higgs_mass_profiled", "hepkg:observable:higgs_self_coupling_modifier", "hepkg:observable:higgs_signal_strength_inclusive", "hepkg:observable:hig