{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-436046a1", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define a region requiring Primary vertex (PV)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define a region requiring a Primary vertex (PV):\n\n- **2004.01678**: Preselection region (m_llj < 250 GeV) and Signal Region (SR)\n- **2009.14537**: Preselection region (opposite-charge same-flavor dilepton, Z-veto, low p_T^ll)\n- **2012.01581**: Common dijet/SV preselection region (Table 2) and Final signal region (Region H)\n- **2107.12553**: Baseline preselection common to all signal regions (Table 6) and 12 non-overlapping signal regions categorized in N_H, N_jets, p_T^miss (Table 8)\n- **2304.08962**: Signal region (SR): tight vertex, m4mu<11 GeV, ΔR<0.25\n- **2401.07090**: Electron channel baseline preselection (B+ mass 4.7-5.7 GeV, prior to q^2 binning)\n- **2403.01556**: Generic emerging-jet signal region (>=2 tagged EJs)\n- **2404.06204**: Detector-level signal regions for W -> e nu, W -> mu nu, Z -> ee, and Z -> mu mu selections\n- **2508.13900**: Common preselection region (all channels)\n\nThese are the distinct papers that define regions requiring a Primary vertex (PV).", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Primary vertex (PV)", "kind": "detector_object"}, "rows": 30, "error": null, "seconds": 14.131}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "region_requires_object", "object_set": "set_1_kept"}, "rows": 9, "error": null, "seconds": 0.031}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:preselection", "hepkg:region:w-enu-detector-sr", "hepkg:region:w-munu-detector-sr", "hepkg:region:z-ee-detector-sr", "hepkg:region:z-mumu-detector-sr", "hepkg:region:preselection_electron", "hepkg:region:signal_region", "hepkg:region:sr-generic"]}, "rows": 15, "error": null, "seconds": 0.011}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:object:CR-Z-VV", "hepkg:object:VR-Z-1F", "hepkg:object:VR-Z-2F", "hepkg:object:VR-Z-VV-btag", "hepkg:object:VR-Z-VV-njet", "hepkg:object:alfa_track", "hepkg:object:dicharmonium_candidate", "hepkg:object:dielectron_vertex", "hepkg:object:dijet_candidate", "hepkg:object:diphoton-primary-vertex", "hepkg:object:electron", "hepkg:object:electron-baseline", "hepkg:object:electron-reco", "hepkg:object:electron_baseline", "hepkg:object:electron_reco", "hepkg:object:electron_signal_detector", "hepkg:object:jpsi_candidate", "hepkg:object:large-radius-jet", "hepkg:object:large_radius_jet", "hepkg:object:lp_electron", "hepkg:object:met", "hepkg:object:missing-transverse-momentum", "hepkg:object:missing_transverse_momentum", "hepkg:object:muon_signal_detector", "hepkg:object:ni_candidate_vertex", "hepkg:object:pf-candidate", "hepkg:object:pf_candidate", "hepkg:object:pf_electron", "hepkg:object:photon", "hepkg:object:primary-vertex", "hepkg:object:primary_vertex", "hepkg:object:psi2s_candidate", "hepkg:object:pt_miss", "hepkg:object:secondary-vertex", "hepkg:object:seco