{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-52eb2efa", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background Multijet background process?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following 14 analyses estimate the Multijet background process:\n\n1. **2007.02873**: *Measurements of \\( WH \\) and \\( ZH \\) production in the \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decay channel in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( 13\\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector*\n2. **2111.08340**: *Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector*\n3. **2202.08676**: *Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)*\n4. **2205.05120**: *Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state*\n5. **2208.12095**: *Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector*\n6. **2208.12095**: *Measurement of the production cross section for a \\( W \\) boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)*\n7. **2308.02285**: *Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations*\n8. **2405.18661**: *CMS t-channel single top quark cross section measurement*\n9. **2408.03744**: *Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for \\( W \\) and \\( Z \\) boson production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=5.02 \\) and 13  TeV*\n10. **2503.19420**: *Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into \\( WW^{\\ast} \\) with the ATLAS detector at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV*\n11. **2510.07527**: *HH->bb tautau analysis result*\n12. **2510.07527**: *HH->bbWW, WW->4q all-hadronic analysis result*\n13. **2602.18611**: *Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)*\n14. **2604.27044**: *Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 \\( b \\) final state*\n\nThese analyses cover a range of processes and final states, and each one provides detailed estimates of the Multijet background.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2007.02873", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2109.13808", "2111.08340", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Multijet", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 21, "error": null, "seconds": 11.102}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 54, "error": null, "seconds": 0.037}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:tchannel_singletop_xsec", "hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:bbtautau", "hepkg:result:bbww_4q", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:dbe00b660bc7b95a46e94404", "hepkg:result:c223e8afe1e53690005d65ee", "hepkg:result:3c55ab19d48206f55f056f4a", "hepkg:result:ca408cb17d5fce2b056fcc4e"]}, "rows": 14, "error": null, "seconds": 0.01}], "sets": {"set_1":