{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-653d3668", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses report the systematic uncertainty t\\bar{t} modelling (theory) uncertainty?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following 16 analyses report the systematic uncertainty related to \\( t\\bar{t} \\) modelling (theory) uncertainty:\n\n1. **2004.14060**: \"Search for a scalar partner of the top quark in the all-hadronic \\( t\\bar{t} \\) plus missing transverse momentum final state at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\"\n2. **2006.05880**: \"Search for top squarks in events with a Higgs or \\( Z \\) boson using 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of \\( pp \\) collision data at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\"\n3. **2007.02873**: \"Measurements of \\( WH \\) and \\( ZH \\) production in the \\( H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decay channel in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( 13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector\"\n4. **2009.04363**: \"Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\"\n5. **2010.14293**: \"Search for squarks and gluinos in final states with jets and missing transverse momentum using 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of \\( \\sqrt{s} =13 \\) TeV \\( pp \\) collision data with the ATLAS detector\"\n6. **2012.03799**: \"Search for new phenomena with top quark pairs in final states with one lepton, jets, and missing transverse momentum in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector\"\n7. **2106.01676**: \"Search for chargino–neutralino pair production in final states with three leptons and missing transverse momentum in \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV \\( pp \\) collisions with the ATLAS detector\"\n8. **2207.00348**: \"Measurement of the properties of Higgs boson production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV in the \\( H\\to\\gamma\\gamma \\) channel using 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of \\( pp \\) collision data with the ATLAS experiment\"\n9. **2208.12095**: \"Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp\\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\"\n10. **2211.08028**: \"Search for supersymmetry in final states with missing transverse momentum and three or more \\( b \\)-jets in 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of proton–proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\"\n11. **2303.15340**: \"Inclusive and differential cross-sections for dilepton \\( t\\bar{t} \\) production measured in \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\) \\( pp \\) collisions with the ATLAS detector\"\n12. **2309.14442**: \"Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}b\\bar{b} \\) production in the lepton+jets channel at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\)\"\n13. **2312.0", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "t tbar modelling theory uncertainty", "kind": "systematic_uncertainty"}, "rows": 120, "error": null, "seconds": 101.762}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_has_systematic", "object_set": "set_1_kept"}, "rows": 25, "error": null, "seconds": 0.043}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"enti