{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-66894990", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the region 12 non-overlapping signal regions categorized in N_H, N_jets, p_T^miss (Table 8)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the region \"12 non-overlapping signal regions categorized in N_H, N_jets, p_T^miss (Table 8)\":\n\n- **2001.06899**: Measurement of the associated production of a \\( Z \\) boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n- **2110.11231**: Measurement of the inclusive and differential \\( WZ \\) production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n- **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\n- **2207.00348**: Measurement of the properties of Higgs boson production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV in the \\( H \\to \\gamma\\gamma \\) channel using 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of \\( pp \\) collision data with the ATLAS experiment\n- **2303.15340**: Inclusive and differential cross-sections for dilepton \\( t\\bar{t} \\) production measured in \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV \\( pp \\) collisions with the ATLAS detector\n- **2309.14442**: Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}b\\bar{b} \\) production in the lepton+jets channel at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n- **2402.08486**: Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n- **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n- **2510.07527**: Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n- **2605.14245**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n\nThese papers define the specified signal regions.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2008.05928", "2009.14537", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2209.07327", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2304.08962", "2309.14442", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "12 non-overlapping signal regions categorized in N_H, N_jets, p_T^miss (Table 8)", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 120, "error": null, "seconds": 110.36}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 121, "error": null, "seconds": 0.047}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:d4ebc4413bef90f04142edbe", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "hepkg:result:a6cd17820e382d3557564ac2", "hepkg:result:672f1e37310a4b762adc7a8c", "hepkg:result:c2a8c