{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-68c2f6c1", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses report the systematic uncertainty tau_h energy scale uncertainty (decay-mode dependent, 0.2%-1.1%)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses report the systematic uncertainty \"tau_h energy scale uncertainty (decay-mode dependent, 0.2%-1.1%)\":\n\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state.\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\).\n- **2503.19420**: Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into \\(WW^{*}\\) with the ATLAS detector at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV.\n\nAdditionally, the following analyses report related systematic uncertainties involving tau_h energy scale:\n\n- **2010.14293**: Search for squarks and gluinos in final states with jets and missing transverse momentum using 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of \\(\\sqrt{s} = 13\\) TeV \\(pp\\) collision data with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2106.14246**: Search for electroweak production of charginos and neutralinos in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\).\n- **2201.11585**: Search for invisible decays of the Higgs boson produced via vector boson fusion in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\).\n- **2211.08028**: Search for supersymmetry in final states with missing transverse momentum and three or more \\(b\\)-jets in 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2511.11853**: Search for a new neutral gauge boson produced in association with one or two \\(b\\) jets and decaying into a pair of muons in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\).\n\nThese analyses collectively cover a range of topics including Higgs boson couplings, multilepton probes, and searches for new particles and supersymmetry.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "tau_h energy scale uncertainty (decay-mode dependent, 0.2%-1.1%)", "kind": "systematic_uncertainty"}, "rows": 120, "error": null, "seconds": 91.073}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_has_systematic", "object_set": "set_1_kept"}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "seconds": 0.036}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:ca408cb17d5fce2b056fcc4e", "hepkg:result:a1be093dbc0132aef0ad80b2", "hepkg:result:8082f0673970bd836137f703", "hepkg:result:327a2c56f1d09ad122ec20c4", "hepkg:result:d6abc95cf998b1c903742a29", "hepkg:result:d0ff6542be328ba2a125a5cb"]}, "rows": 8, "error": null, "seconds": 0.016}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:syst:ggh_vbf_pdf_scale", "hepkg:syst:hcal_inefficiency", "hepkg:syst:jer", "hepkg:syst:jes", "hepkg:syst:jet_calibration_group", "hepkg:syst:je