{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-6e601137", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the region Baseline preselection common to all signal regions (Table 6)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the region \"Baseline preselection common to all signal regions (Table 6)\":\n\n- **2004.01678**: \"Search for Higgs Boson Decays into a $Z$ Boson and a Light Hadronically Decaying Resonance Using 13 TeV $pp$ Collision Data from the ATLAS Detector\"\n- **2009.04363**: \"Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\"\n- **2009.14537**: \"Observation and measurement of forward proton scattering in association with lepton pairs produced via the photon fusion mechanism at ATLAS\"\n- **2103.04956**: \"Measurements of production cross sections of the Higgs boson in the four-lepton final state in proton-proton collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"\n- **2107.12553**: \"Search for chargino-neutralino production in events with Higgs and $\\\\mathup{{{W}}}$ bosons using 137 $\\\\,\\\\text{fb}^{-1}$ of proton-proton collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"\n- **2205.05120**: \"Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\"\n- **2206.09466**: \"Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the $\\\\mathup{{{W}}}$ boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"\n- **2207.00348**: \"Measurement of the properties of Higgs boson production at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV in the $H\\\\to\\\\gamma\\\\gamma$ channel using $139$ fb -1 of $pp$ collision data with the ATLAS experiment\"\n- **2309.14442**: \"Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of ${{\\\\mathup{{{t}}}}{}{\\\\mathup{{\\\\overline{{{\\\\mathup{{{t}}}}}}}}}}{\\\\mathup{{{b}}}}{\\\\mathup{{\\\\overline{{{\\\\mathup{{{b}}}}}}}}}$ production in the lepton+jets channel at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"\n- **2312.04450**: \"Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\"\n- **2401.05299**: \"Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of $t\\\\bar{t}W$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2404.06204**: \"Precise measurements of $W$ - and $Z$ -boson transverse momentum\\nspectra with the ATLAS detector using $pp$ collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=5.02$ TeV and $13$ TeV\"\n- **2503.19420", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Baseline preselection common to all signal regions (Table 6)", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 120, "error": null, "seconds": 107.424}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1_kept"}, "rows": 61, "error": null, "seconds": 0.046}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c0460