{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-700995b9", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses used the sample ZZ diboson production MC sample?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses used the ZZ diboson production MC sample:\n\n- **2004.01678**: \"Search for Higgs Boson Decays into a $Z$ Boson and a Light Hadronically Decaying Resonance Using 13 TeV $pp$ Collision Data from the ATLAS Detector\"\n- **2007.02873**: \"Measurements of $WH$ and $ZH$ production in the $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decay channel in $pp$ collisions at $13\\, \\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2009.04363**: \"Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\"\n- **2102.01444**: \"Search for new phenomena in events with two opposite-charge leptons, jets and missing transverse momentum in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2103.04956**: \"Measurements of production cross sections of the Higgs boson in the four-lepton final state in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2106.14246**: \"Search for electroweak production of charginos and neutralinos in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2107.12553**: \"Search for chargino-neutralino production in events with Higgs and $\\mathup{W}$ bosons using 137 $\\, \\text{fb}^{-1}$ of proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2110.11231**: \"Measurement of the inclusive and differential ${\\mathup{W}}{\\mathup{Z}}$ production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in ${\\mathup{p}}{\\mathup{p}}$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2112.00895**: \"Measurements of the associated production of a W boson and a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=8\\, \\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2112.03161**: \"Search for heavy resonances decaying to a pair of Lorentz-boosted Higgs bosons in final states with leptons and a bottom quark pair at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2201.11585**: \"Search for invisible decays of the Higgs boson produced via vector boson fusion in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2202.08676**: \"Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2205.05120**: \"Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\"\n- **2206.09466**: \"Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the $\\mathup{W}$ boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2401.05299**: \"Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2511.11853", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "ZZ diboson production MC sample", "kind": "sample"}, "rows": 120, "error": null, "seconds": 99.592}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_uses_sample", "object_set": "set_1_kept"}, "rows": 33, "error": null, "seconds": 0.038}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f06