{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-7a4bcdd4", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the object Secondary vertex (SV)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the object \"Secondary vertex (SV)\":\n\n- **2004.04545**: \"$CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the $t\\bar{t}H$ and $tH$ Processes Using $H\\rightarrow\\gamma\\gamma$ with the ATLAS Detector\"\n- **2007.02873**: \"Measurements of $WH$ and $ZH$ production in the $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decay channel in $pp$ collisions at $13\\, \\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2012.01581**: \"Search for long-lived particles using displaced jets in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2308.02285**: \"Measurement of the production cross section for a $\\mathup{{{W}}}$ boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\"\n\nAdditionally, the following analyses define related objects that might be relevant:\n\n- **2004.14060**: \"Search for a scalar partner of the top quark in the all-hadronic $t\\bar{t}$ plus missing transverse momentum final state at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2009.04363**: \"Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\"\n- **2103.04956**: \"Measurements of production cross sections of the Higgs boson in the four-lepton final state in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2109.13808**: \"Constraints on Higgs boson properties using $WW^{*}(\\rightarrow e\\nu\\mu\\nu)jj$ production in $36.1\\, \\text{fb}^{-1}$ of $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$ $pp$ collisions with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2112.00895**: \"Measurements of the associated production of a W boson and a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=8\\, \\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2205.05120**: \"Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\"\n- **2208.12095**: \"Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp\\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2304.08962**: \"Observation of an excess of di-charmonium events in the four-muon final state with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2403.01556**: \"Search for dark QCD with emerging jets in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2404.06204**: \"Precise measurements of $W$ - and $Z$ -boson transverse momentum spectra with the ATLAS detector using $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=5.02\\, \\text{TeV}$ and $13\\, \\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2407.10549**: \"Search for dark matter produced in association with a dark Higgs boson in the", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2103.04956", "2109.13808", "2112.00895", "2205.05120", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2211.08028", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2401.07090", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2407.10549", "2508.13900", "2510.07527", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Secondary vertex (SV)", "kind": "detector_object"}, "rows": 15, "error": null, "seconds": 6.268}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_object", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 37, "error": null, "seconds": 0.056}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:109c1212671935ca00101cdf", "hepkg:result:52d0213216b446bc782fa4dc", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "hepkg:result:c223e8afe1e53690005d65ee", "hepkg:result:3