{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-946f0e46", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the region On-shell WZ selection signal regions (SR^WZ)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the region \"On-shell WZ selection signal regions (SR^WZ)\":\n\n1. **2001.06899**: Measurement of the associated production of a \\( \\mathup{{{Z}}} \\) boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\)   TeV.\n2. **2004.01678**: Search for Higgs Boson Decays into a \\( Z \\) Boson and a Light Hadronically Decaying Resonance Using 13 TeV \\( pp \\) Collision Data from the ATLAS Detector.\n3. **2004.14060**: Search for a scalar partner of the top quark in the all-hadronic \\( t\\bar{t} \\) plus missing transverse momentum final state at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n4. **2007.02873**: Measurements of \\( WH \\) and \\( ZH \\) production in the \\( H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decay channel in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( 13\\, \\text{Te\\kern-1.00006ptV} \\) with the ATLAS detector.\n5. **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons.\n6. **2009.14537**: Observation and measurement of forward proton scattering in association with lepton pairs produced via the photon fusion mechanism at ATLAS.\n7. **2110.11231**: Measurement of the inclusive and differential \\( \\mathup{{{W}}}\\mathup{{{Z}}} \\) production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in \\( \\mathup{{{p}}}\\mathup{{{p}}} \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\).\n8. **2206.09466**: Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the \\( \\mathup{{{W}}} \\) boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\).\n9. **2304.08962**: Observation of an excess of di-charmonium events in the four-muon final state with the ATLAS detector.\n10. **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations.\n11. **2404.06204**: Precise measurements of \\( W \\) - and \\( Z \\) -boson transverse momentum spectra with the ATLAS detector using \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=5.02 \\) TeV and \\( 13 \\) TeV.\n12. **2503.19420**: Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into \\( WW^{*} \\) with the ATLAS detector at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV.\n13. **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "On-shell WZ selection signal regions (SR^WZ)", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 123, "error": null, "seconds": 155.114}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1_kept"}, "rows": 48, "error": null, "seconds": 0.054}, {"round": 3, "tool": "p