ackground normalisation via simultaneous profile likelihood fit | asked: background using Direct MC simulation estimate"}, {"id": "hepkg:method:vv-jet-multiplicity-correction", "why": "Data-driven $N_{\\mathrm{jets}}$-dependent correction to $VV$ simulation | asked: background using Direct MC simulation estimate"}, {"id": "hepkg:method:zplusx_data_driven_misid", "why": "Z+X data-driven estimate using control region and lepton misidentification probabilities | asked: background using Direct MC simulation estimate"}, {"id": "hepkg:method:data_driven_mj_cr", "why": "Data-driven multi-jet-enriched control-region template-fit method | asked: background using Direct MC simulation estimate"}, {"id": "hepkg:method:control_region_data", "why": "Modelled from dedicated control regions in data | asked: background using Direct MC simulation estimate"}]}], "recovered_calls": 0, "cited": "", "abstention_challenged": false, "citation_corrected": false, "citation_disagrees": [], "invented_ids": [], "nudged": false, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 60.985728179104626, "llm_calls": 4.0, "tokens": 29568.0, "rounds": 4.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "set_precision": 0.16666666666666666, "set_recall": 1.0, "set_f1": 0.2857142857142857, "set_named_none": 0.0, "retrieval_reach": 1.0, "tool_calls": 3.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 124.0, "evidence_quotes": 39.0}}
{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-97ed8950", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background Other Higgs background (VH production and H->tautau decays)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate the background \"Other Higgs background (VH production and H->tautau decays)\":\n\n1. **2008.05928**: \"Search for Heavy Resonances Decaying into a Photon and a Hadronically Decaying Higgs Boson in \\( pp \\) Collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS Detector\"\n2. **2103.06956**: \"Measurements of Higgs boson production cross sections and couplings in the diphoton decay channel at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV} \\)\"\n3. **2107.12553**: \"Search for chargino-neutralino production in events with Higgs and \\( W \\) bosons using 137 \\( \\,\\text{fb}^{-1} \\) of proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV} \\)\"\n4. **2109.13808**: \"ggF + 2 jets CP-sensitive analysis of the effective Higgs-gluon coupling\"\n5. **2109.13808**: \"VBF HVV polarisation-coupling analysis (a_L, a_T / kappa_VV, epsilon_VV)\"\n6. **2110.11231**: \"Measurement of the inclusive and differential \\( WZ \\) production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV} \\)\"\n7. **2202.08676**: \"Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV} \\)\"\n8. **2503.19420**: \"Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into \\( WW^{\\ast} \\) with the ATLAS detector at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV} \\)\"\n9. **2604.21670**: \"Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons and the top quark\"\n10. **2605.14245**: \"Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV} \\)\"\n\nThese papers cover a range of analyses involving Higgs boson production and decay, and they specifically estimate the background from VH production and H->tautau decays.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Other Higgs background (VH production and H->tautau decays)", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 46, "error": null, "seconds": 22.054}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1_kept"}, "rows": 12, "error": null, "seconds": 0.029}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:4a162a98ce57274854442b0f", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:180d8e3ba064c02c9c16a8ae", "hepkg:result:61bead068d7011cdb8e37e4c", "hepkg:result:ca408cb17d5fce2b056fcc4e", "hepkg:result:1b05d75dca9cf140bac022d5", "hepkg:result:4fc18dcf1fe256e1dbb021d9", "hepkg:result:vbf_hvv_polarization_analysis", "hepkg:result:ggf2jets_cp_analysis"]}, "rows": 10, "error": null, "seconds": 0.012}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:background:bbgamgam_singleH", "hepkg:background:continuum-tth-th", "hepkg:background:continuum-vh", "hepkg:background:diboson", "hepkg:background:diboson_background", "