{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-9d98f237", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the object Primary vertex (PV)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The following 20 analyses define the object \"Primary vertex (PV)\":\n\n1. **2004.01678**: *Search for Higgs Boson Decays into a $Z$ Boson and a Light Hadronically Decaying Resonance Using 13 TeV $pp$ Collision Data from the ATLAS Detector*\n2. **2004.14060**: *Search for a scalar partner of the top quark in the all-hadronic $t\\bar{t}$ plus missing transverse momentum final state at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector*\n3. **2006.05880**: *Search for top squarks in events with a Higgs or $Z$ boson using 139 fb -1 of $pp$ collision data at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector*\n4. **2007.02873**: *Measurements of $WH$ and $ZH$ production in the $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decay channel in $pp$ collisions at $13\\, \\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector*\n5. **2009.04363**: *Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons*\n6. **2009.14537**: *Observation and measurement of forward proton scattering in association with lepton pairs produced via the photon fusion mechanism at ATLAS*\n7. **2010.14293**: *Search for squarks and gluinos in final states with jets and missing transverse momentum using 139 fb -1 of $\\sqrt{s} =13$ TeV $pp$ collision data with the ATLAS detector*\n8. **2012.01581**: *Search for long-lived particles using displaced jets in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$*\n9. **2012.03799**: *Search for new phenomena with top quark pairs in final states with one lepton, jets, and missing transverse momentum in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector*\n10. **2103.04956**: *Measurements of production cross sections of the Higgs boson in the four-lepton final state in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$*\n11. **2109.13808**: *Constraints on Higgs boson properties using $WW^{*}(→ eνμν)jj$ production in $36.1\\, \\text{fb}^{-1}$ of $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV $pp$ collisions with the ATLAS detector*\n12. **2205.05120**: *Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state*\n13. **2207.00348**: *Measurement of the properties of Higgs boson production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV in the $H\\to\\gamma\\gamma$ channel using $139$ fb -1 of $pp$ collision data with the ATLAS experiment*\n14. **2208.12095**: *Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp\\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector*\n15. **2211.0", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Primary vertex (PV)", "kind": "detector_object"}, "rows": 30, "error": null, "seconds": 12.36}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_object", "object_set": "set_1_kept"}, "rows": 26, "error": null, "seconds": 0.038}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"