{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-a55a29a8", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define a region requiring Particle-level b-jet?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define a region requiring a Particle-level b-jet:\n\n- **2004.01678**: Preselection region (m_llj < 250 GeV)\n- **2004.04545**: Baseline diphoton + b-jet event selection\n- **2007.02873**: \n  - 0-lepton channel signal region (SR)\n  - 1-lepton channel signal region (SR)\n  - 1-lepton channel multi-jet control region (MJ-CR)\n  - 2-lepton channel signal region (SR)\n- **2009.14537**: Preselection region (opposite-charge same-flavor dilepton, Z-veto, low p_T^ll)\n- **2012.01581**: \n  - Common dijet/SV preselection region (Table 2)\n  - Final signal region (Region H)\n- **2102.01444**: CR$^{2-body}_{t\\bar t}$: two-body $t\\bar t$ control region\n- **2106.14246**: 2ℓSS search regions (SS01–SS20)\n- **2107.12553**: \n  - Baseline preselection common to all signal regions (Table 6)\n  - 12 non-overlapping signal regions categorized in N_H, N_jets, p_T^miss (Table 8)\n- **2111.08340**: $t\\bar{t}$ control region (CR$_{t\\bar{t}}$)\n- **2202.08676**: 3L ttZ control region\n- **2304.08962**: Signal region (SR): tight vertex, m4mu<11 GeV, ΔR<0.25\n- **2401.05299**: \n  - 2ℓ SS Signal Region\n  - 3ℓ Signal Region\n  - 2ℓ SS Fiducial Region\n  - 3ℓ Fiducial Region\n  - 3ℓ VV Control Region\n  - 3ℓ IntC Control Region (internal conversion)\n  - 3ℓ MatC Control Region (material conversion)\n\nThese are the distinct papers that define regions requiring a Particle-level b-jet.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.0