{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-a9ace0fb", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses measured Inclusive Higgs boson signal strength modifier (μ = σ×B(H→γγ) / (σ×B)_SM)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses measured the Inclusive Higgs boson signal strength modifier (μ = σ×B(H→γγ) / (σ×B)_SM):\n\n- **2004.04545**: \"$CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the $t\\bar{t}H$ and $tH$ Processes Using $H\\rightarrow\\gamma\\gamma$ with the ATLAS Detector\"\n- **2007.02873**: \"Measurements of $WH$ and $ZH$ production in the $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decay channel in $pp$ collisions at $13\\,\\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2008.05928**: \"Search for Heavy Resonances Decaying into a Photon and a Hadronically Decaying Higgs Boson in $pp$ Collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS Detector\"\n- **2103.04956**: \"Measurements of production cross sections of the Higgs boson in the four-lepton final state in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2103.06956**: \"Measurements of Higgs boson production cross sections and couplings in the diphoton decay channel at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2109.13808**: \"ggF + 2 jets CP-sensitive analysis of the effective Higgs-gluon coupling\"\n- **2111.08340**: \"Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2201.11585**: \"Search for invisible decays of the Higgs boson produced via vector boson fusion in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2207.00348**: \"Measurement of the properties of Higgs boson production at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$ in the $H\\to\\gamma\\gamma$ channel using $139\\,\\text{fb}^{-1}$ of $pp$ collision data with the ATLAS experiment\"\n- **2407.10549**: \"Search for dark matter produced in association with a dark Higgs boson in the $b\\bar{b}$ final state using $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2602.18611**: \"Inclusive Higgs boson signal strength measurement\"\n- **2602.18611**: \"Coupling modifier ratio fit\"\n- **2604.21670**: \"Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons and the top quark\"\n\nThese papers cover a range of measurements related to the inclusive Higgs boson signal strength modifier in various decay channels and production processes.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.04545", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2109.13808", "2111.08340", "2201.11585", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2307.01094", "2401.05299", "2407.10549", "2504.13081", "2510.07527", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Inclusive Higgs boson signal strength modifier (μ = σ×B(H→γγ) / (σ×B)_SM)", "kind": "observable"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 34.886}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_measures_observable", "object_set": "set_1_kept"}, "rows": 21, "error": null, "seconds": 0.04}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:109c1212671935ca00101cdf", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:coupling_modifier_ratios", "hepkg:result:4a162a98ce57274854442b0f", "hepkg:result:incl_signal_strength", "hepkg:result:f8f2454a11f62d465dc04702", "hepkg:result:3c55ab19d48206f55f056f4a", "hepkg:result:61bead068d7011cdb8e37e4c", "hepkg:result:f5b1d9536f2db25c7969a697", "hepkg:result:1b05d75dca9cf140bac022d5", "hepkg:result:ea06bc6559c38a7c9993e3b5", "hepkg:result:327a2c56f1d09ad122ec20c4", "hepkg:result:ggf2jets_cp_analysis"]}, "rows": 13, "error": null, "seconds": 0.01}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:observable:abs_