{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-b43e0e3b", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background ZZ irreducible background?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate the ZZ irreducible background:\n\n1. **2008.05928**: \"Search for Heavy Resonances Decaying into a Photon and a Hadronically Decaying Higgs Boson in \\( pp \\) Collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS Detector\"\n2. **2106.14246**: \"Search for electroweak production of charginos and neutralinos in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\"\n3. **2107.12553**: \"Search for chargino-neutralino production in events with Higgs and \\( W \\) bosons using 137 \\( \\, \\text{fb}^{-1} \\) of proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\"\n4. **2110.11231**: \"Measurement of the inclusive and differential \\( WZ \\) production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\"\n5. **2202.08676**: \"Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\"\n6. **2206.09466**: \"Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the \\( W \\) boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\"\n7. **2304.08962**: \"Observation of an excess of di-charmonium events in the four-muon final state with the ATLAS detector\"\n8. **2312.04450**: \"Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\"\n9. **2401.05299**: \"Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of \\( t\\bar{t}W \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\"\n10. **2404.06204**: \"Precise measurements of \\( W \\) - and \\( Z \\) -boson transverse momentum spectra with the ATLAS detector using \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=5.02 \\) TeV and \\( 13 \\) TeV\"\n11. **2503.19420**: \"Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into \\( WW^{\\ast} \\) with the ATLAS detector at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\"\n12. **2510.07527**: \"HH->bbZZ(4l) analysis result\"\n\nThese papers cover a range of topics, including searches for heavy resonances, measurements of production cross-sections, and studies of Higgs boson decays. Each of these analyses includes the estimation of the ZZ irreducible background.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2208.12095", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2404.06204", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "ZZ irreducible background", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 73, "error": null, "seconds": 61.305}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1_kept"}, "rows": 30, "error": null, "seconds": 0.033}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:bbzz", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:180d8e3ba064c02c9c16a8ae", "hepkg:result:8e885d9541438f775548eee6", "hepkg:result:6b87d4fa6369adc316efb3b5", "hepkg:result:ca408cb17d5fce2b056fcc4e", "hepkg:r