{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-b9727ddc", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses report the systematic uncertainty ECAL upstream material modeling uncertainty?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses report the systematic uncertainty \"ECAL upstream material modeling uncertainty\":\n\n1. **2009.04363**: \"Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\"\n2. **2103.06956**: \"Measurements of Higgs boson production cross sections and couplings in the diphoton decay channel at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV} \\)\"\n3. **2510.07527**: \"Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV} \\)\"\n4. **2605.14245**: \"Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV} \\)\"\n\nThese are the distinct papers that report this systematic uncertainty.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "ECAL upstream material modeling uncertainty", "kind": "sys