{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-c82df4e1", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background Non-$VH$ Higgs boson background (ggF, VBF, $t\\bar{t}H$)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate the background of the Non-$VH$ Higgs boson background (ggF, VBF, $t\\bar{t}H$):\n\n1. **2004.04545**: \"$CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the $t\\bar{t}H$ and $tH$ Processes Using $H\\rightarrow\\gamma\\gamma$ with the ATLAS Detector\"\n2. **2103.06956**: \"Measurements of Higgs boson production cross sections and couplings in the diphoton decay channel at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n3. **2107.12553**: \"Search for chargino-neutralino production in events with Higgs and $\\mathup{{{W}}}$ bosons using 137 $\\,\\text{fb}^{-1}$ of proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n4. **2109.13808**: \"VBF HVV polarisation-coupling analysis (a_L, a_T / kappa_VV, epsilon_VV)\"\n5. **2112.03161**: \"Search for heavy resonances decaying to a pair of Lorentz-boosted Higgs bosons in final states with leptons and a bottom quark pair at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n6. **2205.05120**: \"Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\"\n7. **2207.00348**: \"Measurement of the properties of Higgs boson production at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$ in the $H\\to\\gamma\\gamma$ channel using $139\\,\\text{fb}^{-1}$ of $pp$ collision data with the ATLAS experiment\"\n8. **2208.12095**: \"Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp\\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector\"\n9. **2304.08962**: \"Observation of an excess of di-charmonium events in the four-muon final state with the ATLAS detector\"\n10. **2307.01094**: \"Search for pair production of squarks or gluinos decaying via sleptons or weak bosons in final states with two same-sign or three leptons with the ATLAS detector\"\n11. **2312.04450**: \"Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\"\n12. **2401.05299**: \"Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of $t\\bar{t}W$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector\"\n13. **2405.18661**: \"CMS ttbar+Z0 (ttZ) associated production cross section measurement\"\n14. **2503.19420**: \"Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into $WW^{\\ast}$ with the ATLAS detector at $\\sqrt{s}=", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Non-VH Higgs boson background (ggF, VBF, ttH)", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 51, "error": null, "seconds": 28.751}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1_kept"}, "rows": 28, "error": null, "seconds": 0.038}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:109c1212671935ca00101cdf", "hepkg:result:ttz_measurement", "hepkg:result:5a41a