{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-ef1c5431", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the object Particle-level b-jet?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the object \"Particle-level b-jet\":\n\n1. **2012.03799**: *Search for new phenomena with top quark pairs in final states with one lepton, jets, and missing transverse momentum in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\ \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector*\n2. **2107.12553**: *Search for chargino-neutralino production in events with Higgs and \\( W \\) bosons using 137 \\( \\text{fb}^{-1} \\) of proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\ \\text{TeV} \\)*\n3. **2111.08340**: *Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector*\n4. **2112.03161**: *Search for heavy resonances decaying to a pair of Lorentz-boosted Higgs bosons in final states with leptons and a bottom quark pair at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\ \\text{TeV} \\)*\n5. **2303.15340**: *Inclusive and differential cross-sections for dilepton \\( t\\bar{t} \\) production measured in \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\ \\text{TeV} \\) \\( pp \\) collisions with the ATLAS detector*\n6. **2309.14442**: *Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}b\\bar{b} \\) production in the lepton+jets channel at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\ \\text{TeV} \\)*\n7. **2402.08486**: *Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\ \\text{TeV} \\)*\n8. **2506.13565**: *Search for nonresonant new physics signals in high-mass dilepton events produced in association with \\( b \\)-tagged jets in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\ \\text{TeV} \\)*\n9. **2604.27044**: *Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 \\( b \\) final state*\n\nThese analyses define various types of particle-level b-jets, including H→bb candidate large-R jets, b-tagged AK4 jets, and others. Each analysis provides specific definitions and uses for these objects in their respective contexts.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Particle-level b-jet", "kind": "detector_object"}, "rows": 47, "error": null, "seconds": 22.108}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_object", "object_set": "set_1_kept"}, "rows": 12, "error": null, "seconds": 0.033}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:d4ebc4413bef90f04142edbe", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:a6cd17820e382d3557564ac2", "hepkg:result:672f1e37310a4b762adc7a8c", "hepkg:result:4fc18dcf1fe256e1dbb021d9", "hepkg:result:faf187c3052688d9764c6e95", "hepkg:result:ae72705e5773a32c5f251172", "hepkg:result:989da7e0af809d38ad040be8"]}, "rows": 9, "error": null, "seconds": 0.01}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:object:Jb-jet", "hepkg:object