{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-02fec494", "repeat": 2, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses used the sample SUSY stop-pair signal sample (MadGraph 2.6.2 + Pythia 8)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses used the sample \"SUSY stop-pair signal sample (MadGraph 2.6.2 + Pythia 8)\":\n\n- **2004.04545**: \"$CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the $t\\\\bar{t}H$ and $tH$ Processes Using $H\\\\rightarrow\\\\gamma\\\\gamma$ with the ATLAS Detector\"\n- **2110.11231**: \"Measurement of the inclusive and differential ${\\\\mathup{{{W}}}}{\\\\mathup{{{Z}}}}$ production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in ${\\\\mathup{{{p}}}}{\\\\mathup{{{p}}}}$ collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"\n- **2205.05120**: \"Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\"\n- **2207.00348**: \"Measurement of the properties of Higgs boson production at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV in the $H\\\\to\\\\gamma\\\\gamma$ channel using $139$ fb -1 of $pp$ collision data with the ATLAS experiment\"\n- **2208.12095**: \"Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp\\\\rightarrow t\\\\bar{t}$ production at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2303.15340**: \"Inclusive and differential cross-sections for dilepton $t\\\\bar{t}$ production measured in $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\;$ TeV $pp$ collisions with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2308.02285**: \"Measurement of the production cross section for a $\\\\mathup{{{W}}}$ boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"\n- **2309.14442**: \"Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of ${{\\\\mathup{{{t}}}}{}{\\\\mathup{{\\\\overline{{{\\\\mathup{{{t}}}}}}}}}}{\\\\mathup{{{b}}}}{\\\\mathup{{\\\\overline{{{\\\\mathup{{{b}}}}}}}}}$ production in the lepton+jets channel at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"\n- **2312.04450**: \"Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\"\n- **2402.08486**: \"Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from ${\\\\mathup{{{p}}}}{\\\\mathup{{{p}}}}$ collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"\n- **2405.18661**: \"CMS Z+jets differential cross section measurement (jet multiplicity) at 13 TeV\"\n- **2405.18661**: \"CMS W boson charge asymmetry measurement\"\n- **2", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2205.05120", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "SUSY stop-pair signal sample (MadGraph 2.6.2 + Pythia 8)", "kind": "sample"}, "rows": 129, "error": null, "seconds": 179.383}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_uses_sample", "object_set": "set_1_kept"}, "rows": 52, "error": null, "seconds": 0.045}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:res