{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-08d92079", "repeat": 2, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses used the sample Z' -> Hγ signal MC sample (eight mass points, 700-4000 GeV)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses used the sample \"Z' -> Hγ signal MC sample (eight mass points, 700-4000 GeV)\":\n\n- **2004.04545**: \"$CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the $t\\bar{t}H$ and $tH$ Processes Using $H\\rightarrow\\gamma\\gamma$ with the ATLAS Detector\"\n- **2009.04363**: \"Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\"\n- **2111.08340**: \"Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2202.08676**: \"Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2312.04450**: \"Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\"\n- **2508.13900**: \"General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2510.07527**: \"Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2604.27044**: \"Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 $b$ final state\"\n- **2605.14245**: \"Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n\nThese are the distinct papers that used the specified sample.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008