\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\)\n- **2404.06204**: Precise measurements of \\( W \\) - and \\( Z \\) -boson transverse momentum spectra with the ATLAS detector using \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=5.02 \\) TeV and \\( 13 \\) TeV\n- **2405.18661**: Stairway to discovery: a report on the CMS programme of cross section measurements from millibarns to femtobarns\n- **2503.19420**: Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into \\( WW^{\\\\ast} \\) with the ATLAS detector at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n- **2510.07527**: Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\)\n- **2602.18611**: Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2009.14537", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2112.00895", "2202.08676", "2207.00348", "2303.15340", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2510.07527", "2602.18611", "2604.21670"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "H->4l fiducial phase space (particle level)", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 34.58}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1_kept"}, "rows": 19, "error": null, "seconds": 0.042}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437", "hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "hepkg:result:d4ebc4413bef90f04142edbe", "hepkg:result:a6cd17820e382d3557564ac2", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:672f1e37310a4b762adc7a8c", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:1724c3004deb2fe7c06e27d8", "hepkg:result:c223e8afe1e53690005d65ee", "hepkg:result:f5b1d9536f2db25c7969a697", "hepkg:result:98870936d56c0284b1c0a718", "hepkg