{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-52e8747d", "repeat": 2, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses report the systematic uncertainty Hadronic recoil scale and resolution calibration uncertainty?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses report the systematic uncertainty \"Hadronic recoil scale and resolution calibration uncertainty\":\n\n- **2001.06899**: Measurement of the associated production of a \\( \\mathup{{{Z}}} \\) boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\)   TeV\n- **2408.03744**: Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for \\( \\mathup{{{W}}} \\) and \\( \\mathup{{{Z}}} \\) boson production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=5.02 \\) and 13  TeV\n- **2404.06204**: Precise measurements of \\( W \\) - and \\( Z \\) -boson transverse momentum spectra with the ATLAS detector using \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=5.02 \\) TeV and \\( 13 \\) TeV\n\nAdditionally, the following analyses report the systematic uncertainty \"Jet energy scale and resolution uncertainty\" (which is closely related):\n\n- **2001.06899**: Measurement of the associated production of a \\( \\mathup{{{Z}}} \\) boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\)   TeV\n- **2006.05880**: Search for top squarks in events with a Higgs or \\( Z \\) boson using 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of \\( pp \\) collision data at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2007.02873**: Measurements of \\( WH \\) and \\( ZH \\) production in the \\( H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decay channel in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( 13\\, \\text{Te\\kern-1.00006ptV} \\) with the ATLAS detector\n- **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\n- **2010.14293**: Search for squarks and gluinos in final states with jets and missing transverse momentum using 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of \\( \\sqrt{s} \\) =13 TeV \\( pp \\) collision data with the ATLAS detector\n- **2103.06956**: Measurements of Higgs boson production cross sections and couplings in the diphoton decay channel at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\)\n- **2106.01676**: Search for chargino–neutralino pair production in final states with three leptons and missing transverse momentum in \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV \\( pp \\) collisions with the ATLAS detector\n- **2106.14246**: Search for electroweak production of charginos and neutralinos in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV} \\)\n- **2109.13808**: ggF + 2 jets CP-sensitive analysis of the effective Higgs-gluon coupling\n- **2109.13808**: VBF HVV polarisation-coupling analysis (a_L, a_T / kappa_VV, epsilon_VV)\n- **2112.00895", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Hadronic recoil scale and resolution calibration uncertainty", "kind": "systematic_uncertainty"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 32.245}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_has_systematic", "object_set": "set_1_kept"}, "rows": 25, "error": null, "seconds": 0.039}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids"