{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-5302a248", "repeat": 2, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the object Charged-particle ID track?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the object \"Charged-particle ID track\":\n\n- **2004.01678**: *Search for Higgs Boson Decays into a $Z$ Boson and a Light Hadronically Decaying Resonance Using 13 TeV $pp$ Collision Data from the ATLAS Detector*\n- **2008.05928**: *Search for Heavy Resonances Decaying into a Photon and a Hadronically Decaying Higgs Boson in $pp$ Collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS Detector*\n- **2009.14537**: *Observation and measurement of forward proton scattering in association with lepton pairs produced via the photon fusion mechanism at ATLAS*\n- **2011.07812**: *Search for displaced leptons in $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV $pp$ collisions with the ATLAS detector*\n- **2012.01581**: *Search for long-lived particles using displaced jets in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$*\n- **2012.08600**: *Search for supersymmetry in final states with two oppositely charged same-flavor leptons and missing transverse momentum in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$*\n- **2103.06956**: *Measurements of Higgs boson production cross sections and couplings in the diphoton decay channel at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$*\n- **2107.12553**: *Search for chargino-neutralino production in events with Higgs and $W$ bosons using 137 $\\, \\text{fb}^{-1}$ of proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$*\n- **2207.12246**: *Measurement of the total cross section and $\\rho$-parameter from elastic scattering in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector*\n- **2307.01094**: *Search for pair production of squarks or gluinos decaying via sleptons or weak bosons in final states with two same-sign or three leptons with the ATLAS detector*\n- **2401.07090**: *Test of lepton flavor universality in $B^\\pm \\to K^\\pm \\ell^+ \\ell^-$ and $B^\\pm \\to K^\\pm \\mu^+ \\mu^-$ decays*\n- **2402.08486**: *Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$*\n- **2403.01556**: *Search for dark QCD with emerging jets in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$*\n- **2604.21670**: *Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons, and the top quark*\n\nThese are the distinct papers that define the object \"Charged-particle ID track.\"\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The following analyses define the object 'Charged-particle ID track':\\n- 2004.01678: *Search for Higgs Boson Decays into a $Z", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Charged-particle ID track", "kind": "detector_object"}, "rows": 47, "error": null, "seconds": 22.715}, {"round": 2, "too