{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-53c3199d", "repeat": 2, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses report the systematic uncertainty Pileup jet identification (misidentification rate) uncertainty?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses report the systematic uncertainty \"Pileup jet identification (misidentification rate) uncertainty\":\n\n1. **2103.06956**: *Measurements of Higgs boson production cross sections and couplings in the diphoton decay channel at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)*\n2. **2107.12553**: *Search for chargino-neutralino production in events with Higgs and \\( \\mathup{{{W}}} \\) bosons using 137 \\( \\, \\text{fb}^{-1} \\) of proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)*\n3. **2112.00895**: *Measurements of the associated production of a W boson and a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=8\\, \\text{TeV} \\)*\n4. **2206.09466**: *Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the \\( \\mathup{{{W}}} \\) boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)*\n5. **2308.02285**: *Measurement of the production cross section for a \\( \\mathup{{{W}}} \\) boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)*\n6. **2401.07090**: *Muon channel single ratio B(B+->K+mu+mu-)/B(B+->J/psi(mu+mu-)K+)*\n7. **2403.01556**: *Search for dark QCD with emerging jets in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)*\n8. **2503.19420**: *Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into \\( WW^{\\\\ast} \\) with the ATLAS detector at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV*\n9. **2511.11853**: *Search for a new neutral gauge boson produced in association with one or two b jets and decaying into a pair of muons in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)*\n10. **2605.14245**: *Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)*\n\nThese analyses have reported the systematic uncertainty related to pileup jet identification (misidentification rate).", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Pileup jet identification (misidentification rate) uncertainty", "kind": "systematic_uncertainty"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 31.03}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_has_systematic", "object_set": "set_1_kept"}, "rows": 10, "error": null, "seconds": 0.039}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:c223e8afe1e53690005d65ee", "hepkg:result:61bead068d7011cdb8e37e4c", "hepkg:result:6b87d4fa6369adc316efb3b5", "hepkg:result:98870936d56c0284b1c0a718", "hepkg:result:ca408cb17d5fce2b056fcc4e", "hepkg:result:muon_single_ratio", "hepkg:result:a1be093dbc0132aef0ad80b2", "hepkg:result:4fc18dcf1fe256e1dbb021d9", "hepkg:result:6bc442f4b330b7ddaa82