{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-6c12701d", "repeat": 2, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define a region requiring Secondary vertex (SV)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define a region requiring a Secondary Vertex (SV):\n\n- **2004.01678**: Preselection region (m_llj < 250 GeV)\n- **2009.14537**: Preselection region (opposite-charge same-flavor dilepton, Z-veto, low p_T^ll)\n- **2012.01581**: Common dijet/SV preselection region (Table 2), Final signal region (Region H), Data control region used as background sample for GBDT training (epsilon<0.12, orthogonal to SR)\n- **2012.03799**: bffN_softb signal region\n- **2107.12553**: Baseline preselection common to all signal regions (Table 6), 12 non-overlapping signal regions categorized in N_H, N_jets, p_T^miss (Table 8)\n- **2112.00895**: SV channel selection, W->e nu decay (reconstructed), SV channel selection, W->mu nu decay (reconstructed)\n- **2304.08962**: Signal region (SR): tight vertex, m4mu<11 GeV, ΔR<0.25, Control region (CR): ΔR>=0.25, used to validate SPS shape, Non-prompt region: reversed vertex-quality requirements, SPS control region: 4mu mass sideband [7.5,12] GeV, no ΔR requirement, DPS control region: 4mu mass sideband [14,24.5] GeV, no ΔR requirement\n- **2308.02285**: SV (secondary vertex) charm-tag selection region\n- **2508.13900**: Common preselection region (all channels), 0L, 0 S-jet category, 0L, 1 S-jet category, 1L, 0 S-jet category, 1L, 1 S-jet category, 2L, 0 S-jet category, Model-independent superbin: SV\n\nThese are the distinct papers that define regions requiring a Secondary Vertex (SV).\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The following analyses define a region requiring a Secondary Vertex (SV):\\n\\n- **2004.01678**: Preselection region (m_llj < 250 GeV)\\n- **2009.14537**: Preselection region (opposite-charge same-flavor dilepton, Z-veto, low p_T^ll)\\n- **2012.01581**: Common dijet/SV preselection region (Table 2), Final signal region (Region H), Data control region used as background sample for GBDT training (epsilon<0.12, orthogonal to SR)\\n- **2012.03799**: bffN_softb signal region\\n- **2107.12553**: Baseline preselection common to all signal regions (Table 6), 12 non-overlapping signal regions categorized in N_H, N_jets, p_T^miss (Table 8)\\n- **2112.00895**: SV channel selection, W->e nu decay (reconstructed), SV channel selection, W->mu nu decay (reconstructed)\\n- **2304.08962**: Signal region (SR): tight vertex, m4mu<11 GeV, ΔR<0.25, Control", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2103.04956", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2112.00895", "2205.05120", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2211.08028", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2401.07090", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2407.10549", "2508.13900", "2510.07527", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Secondary vertex (SV)", "kind": "detector_object"}, "rows": 15, "error": null, "seconds": 6.294}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "region_requires_object", "object_set": "set_1_kept"}, "rows": 21, "error": null, "seconds": 0.034}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:0l-0j", "hepkg:region:0l-1j", "hepkg:region:1l-0j", "hepkg:region:1l-1j", "hepkg:region:2l-0j", "hepkg:region:preselection", "hepkg:region:control_region", "hepkg:region:dps_control_region", "hepkg:region:gbdt_training_background_region", "hepkg:region:signal_region", "hepkg:region:superbin-sv", "hepkg:region:nonprompt_region", "hepkg:region:sps_control_region", "hepkg:region:sv-charm-tag", "hepkg:region:sv_electron", "hepkg:region:sv_muon", "hepkg:region:SR-bffN_sof