{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-6ee69a45", "repeat": 2, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the region γ+jets control region (available only in the MTR category)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the region γ+jets control region (available only in the MTR category):\n\n- 2001.06899: Measurement of the associated production of a Z boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at √s=13 TeV\n- 2007.02873: Measurements of WH and ZH production in the H→b̄b decay channel in pp collisions at 13 TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- 2008.05928: Search for Heavy Resonances Decaying into a Photon and a Hadronically Decaying Higgs Boson in pp Collisions at √s=13 TeV with the ATLAS Detector\n- 2110.11231: Measurement of the inclusive and differential WZ production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in pp collisions at √s=13 TeV\n- 2111.08340: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using H→b̄b decays in the ATLAS detector\n- 2206.09466: Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the W boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at √s=13 TeV\n- 2303.15340: Inclusive and differential cross-sections for dilepton t̄t production measured in √s=13 TeV pp collisions with the ATLAS detector\n- 2304.08962: Observation of an excess of di-charmonium events in the four-muon final state with the ATLAS detector\n- 2401.05299: Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of t̄tW production in pp collisions at √s=13 TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- 2404.06204: Precise measurements of W - and Z -boson transverse momentum spectra with the ATLAS detector using pp collisions at √s=5.02 TeV and 13 TeV\n- 2503.19420: Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into WW* with the ATLAS detector at √s=13 TeV\n- 2508.13900: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at √s=13 TeV\n- 2511.11853: Search for a new neutral gauge boson produced in association with one or two b jets and decaying into a pair of muons in proton-proton collisions at √s=13 TeV\n- 2605.14245: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at √s=13 TeV", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.14060", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2010.14293", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2209.07327", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2304.08962", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2407.10549", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "γ+jets control region", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 120, "error": null, "seconds": 95.067}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1_kept"}, "rows": 40, "error": null, "seconds": 0.053}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "hepkg:result:672f1e37310a4b762adc7a8c", "hepkg:result:1724c3004deb2fe7c06e27d8", "hepkg:result:180d8e3ba064c02c9c16a8ae", "hepkg:result:8e885d9541438f775548eee6", "hepkg:result:3c55ab19d48206f55f056f4a", "hepkg:result:6b87d4fa6369adc316efb3b5", "hepkg:result:ca408cb17d5fce2b056fcc4e", "hepkg:result:694974132a345b577852238c", "hepkg:result:ed295e954b4df9d734d7c339", "hepkg:result:1b05d75dca9cf140bac022d5", "hepkg:result:a1be093dbc0132aef0ad80b2"]}, "rows":