our modelling uncertainty | asked: t\\bar{t} initial- and final-state radiation modelling uncertainty"}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:photon-energy-scale", "why": "Photon energy scale uncertainty | asked: t\\bar{t} initial- and final-state radiation modelling uncertainty"}, {"id": "hepkg:syst:hcal_inefficiency", "why": "HCAL readout-loss (Run 2) jet energy scale uncertainty | asked: t\\bar{t} initial- and final-state radiation modelling uncertainty"}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:signal-acceptance-modelling", "why": "SUSY/DM signal acceptance modelling uncertainty (radiation, factorisation/renormalisation/matching scales) | asked: t\\bar{t} initial- and final-state radiation modelling uncertainty"}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:pileup_inelastic_xs", "why": "Pileup modelling uncertainty from inelastic pp cross section (4.6%) and pileup distribution shape | asked: t\\bar{t} initial- and final-state radiation modelling uncertainty"}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:signal-pileup", "why": "Pileup (inelastic pp cross section) uncertainty on signal yield | asked: t\\bar{t} initial- and final-state radiation modelling uncertainty"}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:multijet_modelling", "why": "multi-jet uncertainty | asked: t\\bar{t} initial- and final-state radiation modelling uncertainty"}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:photon_energy_resolution_estimate", "why": "Per-photon energy resolution estimate uncertainty | asked: t\\bar{t} initial- and final-state radiation modelling uncertainty"}]}], "recovered_calls": 0, "cited": "", "abstention_challenged": false, "citation_corrected": false, "citation_disagrees": [], "invented_ids": [], "nudged": false, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 44.89301361981779, "llm_calls": 3.0, "tokens": 16843.0, "rounds": 3.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "set_precision": 0.0851063829787234, "set_recall": 1.0, "set_f1": 0.1568627450980392, "set_named_no