{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-8885152b", "repeat": 2, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background $VVV$ background?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate the $VVV$ background:\n\n1. **2102.01444**: *Search for new phenomena in events with two opposite-charge leptons, jets and missing transverse momentum in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector*\n2. **2110.11231**: *Measurement of the inclusive and differential \\( WZ \\) production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\)*\n3. **2307.01094**: *Search for pair production of squarks or gluinos decaying via sleptons or weak bosons in final states with two same-sign or three leptons with the ATLAS detector*\n4. **2312.04450**: *Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations*\n5. **2401.05299**: *Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of \\( t\\bar{t}W \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector*\n6. **2503.19420**: *Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into \\( WW^{\\ast} \\) with the ATLAS detector at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV*\n7. **2506.13565**: *Search for nonresonant new physics signals in high-mass dilepton events produced in association with \\( b \\)-tagged jets in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\)*\n\nThese papers cover a range of processes and final states, and they all include estimates of the $VVV$ background in their analyses.", "answered": true, "