{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-8fedcb7c", "repeat": 2, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses measured f_a2 (HVV effective fractional cross section)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses measured f_a2 (HVV effective fractional cross section):\n\n- 2001.06899: Measurement of the associated production of a Z boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at √s=13 TeV\n- 2103.04956: Measurements of production cross sections of the Higgs boson in the four-lepton final state in proton-proton collisions at √s=13 TeV\n- 2103.06956: Measurements of Higgs boson production cross sections and couplings in the diphoton decay channel at √s=13 TeV\n- 2207.00348: Measurement of the properties of Higgs boson production at √s=13 TeV in the H→γγ channel using 139 fb^-1 of pp collision data with the ATLAS experiment\n- 2312.04450: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of t̄tZ production in pp collisions at √s=13 TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\n- 2602.18611: Per-decay-channel Higgs boson signal strength measurement and STXS stage 0 production cross section and branching fraction ratio measurement\n- 2604.27044: Resolved Run 3 analysis, first approach (transformer-based) HH results, Resolved Run 3 analysis, second approach (FeynNet GNN) HH results, Merged Run 3 analysis, first approach, mass-fit method results, Merged Run 3 analysis, first approach, DNN-fit method results, Merged Run 3 analysis, second approach (parametric alphabet) results, Combined Run 3 resolved+merged HH→4b result, Combined Run 2 + Run 3 HH→4b result", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2009.04363", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2302.05225", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2504.1308