{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-958c421f", "repeat": 2, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses report the systematic uncertainty Diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ) background modelling uncertainty?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses report the systematic uncertainty \"Diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ) background modelling uncertainty\":\n\n1. **2006.05880**: \"Search for top squarks in events with a Higgs or \\( Z \\) boson using 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of \\( pp \\) collision data at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\"\n2. **2007.02873**: \"Measurements of \\( WH \\) and \\( ZH \\) production in the \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decay channel in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( 13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector\"\n3. **2010.14293**: \"Search for squarks and gluinos in final states with jets and missing transverse momentum using 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of \\( \\sqrt{s} = 13 \\) TeV \\( pp \\) collision data with the ATLAS detector\"\n4. **2106.14246**: \"Search for electroweak production of charginos and neutralinos in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\)\"\n5. **2110.11231**: \"Total inclusive WZ production cross section measurement (combined flavour categories)\"\n6. **2202.08676**: \"Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\)\"\n7. **2302.05225**: \"Searches for lepton-flavour-violating decays of the Higgs boson into \\( e\\tau \\) and \\( \\mu\\tau \\) in \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\) \\( pp \\) collisions with the ATLAS detector\"\n8. **2312.04450**: \"Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\"\n9. **2401.05299**: \"Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of \\( t\\bar{t}W \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\"\n10. **2508.13900**: \"General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\)\"\n11. **2604.27044**: \"Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 \\( b \\) final state\"\n\nThese papers cover a range of topics, including searches for supersymmetric particles, measurements of Higgs boson pair production, and studies of various production cross-sections involving top quarks and dibosons. Each of these analyses reports the systematic uncertainty related to the modelling of diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ) backgrounds.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ) background modelling uncertainty", "kind": "systematic_uncertainty"}, "rows": 120, "error": null, "seconds": 98.665}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_has_systematic", "object_set": "set_1_kept"}, "rows": 15, "error": null, "seconds": 0.048}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "he