{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-99be86b0", "repeat": 2, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses measured Jet multiplicity (N_jets)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses measured Jet multiplicity (N_jets):\n\n- **2103.04956**: *Measurements of production cross sections of the Higgs boson in the four-lepton final state in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$*\n- **2309.14442**: *Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of ${{\\mathup{{{t}}}}{}{\\mathup{{\\overline{{\\mathup{{{t}}}}}}}}{\\mathup{{{b}}}}{\\mathup{{\\overline{{\\mathup{{{b}}}}}}}}$ production in the lepton+jets channel at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$*\n- **2312.04450**: *Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations*\n- **2401.05299**: *Absolute differential cross-section vs $N_{\\mathrm{jets}}$ result*, *Normalised differential cross-section vs $N_{\\mathrm{jets}}$ result*, and *$A_{\\mathrm{C}}^{\\mathrm{rel}}$ vs $N_{\\mathrm{jets}}$ result*\n- **2402.08486**: *Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from ${\\mathup{{{p}}}}{\\mathup{{{p}}}}$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$*\n- **2504.13081**: *Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$*\n- **2511.11853**: *Search for a new neutral gauge boson produced in association with one or two b jets and decaying into a pair of muons in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$*\n\nThese are the distinct papers that have measured Jet multiplicity (N_jets) in their analyses.", "answered": true, "pape