{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-aae70731", "repeat": 2, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate a background using Data-driven misidentification/prompt-rate (fake rate) method?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following 12 papers estimate backgrounds using the \"Data-driven misidentification/prompt-rate (fake rate) method\":\n\n1. **2007.02873**: \"Measurements of \\( WH \\) and \\( ZH \\) production in the \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decay channel in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( 13\\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector\"\n2. **2110.11231**: \"Measurement of the inclusive and differential \\( WZ \\) production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\"\n3. **2202.08676**: \"Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\"\n4. **2208.12095**: \"Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\"\n5. **2303.15340**: \"Inclusive and differential cross-sections for dilepton \\( t\\bar{t} \\) production measured in \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\) \\( pp \\) collisions with the ATLAS detector\"\n6. **2308.02285**: \"Measurement of the production cross section for a \\( W \\) boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\"\n7. **2312.04450**: \"Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\"\n8. **2401.05299**: \"Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of \\( t\\bar{t}W \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\"\n9. **2503.19420**: \"Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into \\( WW^{\\ast} \\) with the ATLAS detector at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\"\n10. **2508.13900**: \"General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\"\n11. **2602.18611**: \"Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\"\n12. **2604.27044**: \"Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 \\( b \\) final state\"\n\nThese papers cover a range of analyses involving various processes and final states, all of which use the data-driven misidentification/prompt-rate (fake rate) method to estimate backgrounds.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The following 12 papers estimate backgrounds using the 'Data-driven misidentification/prompt-rate (fake rate) method':\\n\\n1. **2007.02873**: 'Measurements of", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "facets", "args": {"field": "background_methods", "values": ["DataDriven