{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-cd1c2f68", "repeat": 2, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses used the sample Single top tW sample (powheg v2)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The following analyses used the sample 'Single top tW sample (powheg v2)':\\n- 2001.06899: Measurement of the associated production of a Z boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at √s=13 TeV\\n- 2006.05880: Search for top squarks in events with a Higgs or Z boson using 139 fb^-1 of pp collision data at √s=13 TeV with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2007.02873: Measurements of WH and ZH production in the H→bb̄ decay channel in pp collisions at 13 TeV with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2010.14293: Search for squarks and gluinos in final states with jets and missing transverse momentum using 139 fb^-1 of √s=13 TeV pp collision data with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2106.01676: Search for chargino–neutralino pair production in final states with three leptons and missing transverse momentum in √s=13 TeV pp collisions with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2112.03161: Search for heavy resonances decaying to a pair of Lorentz-boosted Higgs bosons in final states with leptons and a bottom quark pair at √s=13 TeV\\n- 2205.05120: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\\n- 2206.09466: Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the W boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at √s=13 TeV\\n- 2208.12095: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in pp→tt̄ production at √s=13 TeV with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2209.07327: Search for pair production of vector-like quarks in leptonic final states in proton-proton collisions at √s=13 TeV\\n- 2211.08028: Search for supersymmetry in final states with missing transverse momentum and three or more b-jets in 139 fb^-1 of proton–proton collisions at √s=13 TeV with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2302.05225: Searches for lepton-flavour-violating decays of the Higgs boson into eτ and μτ in √s=13 TeV pp collisions with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2303.15340: Inclusive and differential cross-sections for dilepton tt̄ production measured in √s=13 TeV pp collisions with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2307.01094: Search for pair production of squarks or gluinos decaying via sleptons or weak bosons in final states with two same-sign or three leptons with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2308.02285: Measurement of the production cross section for a W boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at √s=13 TeV\\n- 2309.14442: Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of tt̄b̄", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2604.21670", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Single top tW sample (powheg v2)", "kind": "sample"}, "rows": 120, "error": null, "seconds": 98.317}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_uses_sample", "object_set": "set_1_kept"}, "rows": 28, "error": null, "seconds": 0.042}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62cea