{"run_id": "20260816T233639-hepkg-48572", "qid": "gen-conceptset-eac8c8cb", "repeat": 2, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "92159134c9c3", "git_sha": "be3072a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses report the systematic uncertainty Secondary vertex charge assignment uncertainty?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following 14 analyses report the systematic uncertainty \"Secondary vertex charge assignment uncertainty\" or related uncertainties:\n\n1. **2012.01581**: *Search for long-lived particles using displaced jets in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$*\n2. **2103.06956**: *Measurements of Higgs boson production cross sections and couplings in the diphoton decay channel at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$*\n3. **2106.14246**: *Search for electroweak production of charginos and neutralinos in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$*\n4. **2110.11231**: *WZ charge asymmetry ratio measurement $A^{+-}_{WZ}$*\n5. **2112.00895**: *Measurements of the associated production of a W boson and a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=8\\,\\text{TeV}$*\n6. **2202.08676**: *Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$*\n7. **2207.00348**: *Measurement of the properties of Higgs boson production at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$ in the $H\\to\\gamma\\gamma$ channel using $139\\,\\text{fb}^{-1}$ of $pp$ collision data with the ATLAS experiment*\n8. **2208.12095**: *Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp\\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector*\n9. **2209.07327**: *Search for pair production of vector-like quarks in leptonic final states in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$*\n10. **2303.15340**: *Inclusive and differential cross-sections for dilepton $t\\bar{t}$ production measured in $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$ $pp$ collisions with the ATLAS detector*\n11. **2307.01094**: *Search for pair production of squarks or gluinos decaying via sleptons or weak bosons in final states with two same-sign or three leptons with the ATLAS detector*\n12. **2308.02285**: *Measurement of the production cross section for a $W$ boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$*\n13. **2308.02285**: *Measurement of the production cross section for a $W$ boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$* (repeated)\n14. **2401.05299**: *Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of $t\\bar{t}W$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector*\n15. **2404.06204**: *Precise measurements of $W$ - and $Z$ -boson transverse momentum spectra with the ATLAS detector using $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=5.02\\,\\text{", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Secondary vertex charge assignment uncertainty", "kind": "systematic_uncertainty"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 31.151}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_has_systematic", "object_set": "set_1_kept"}, "rows": 19, "error": null, "seconds": 0.043}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args":